%% Phase4 / timeline / G-10d 离底 anchor 与新消息提示
%% Helix owners: query/local_first.rs; timeline_navigation.rs; event/timeline.rs
%% 当前目标不发布 activate-window directive；离底状态只由 timeline absolute data 表达。
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as PC Angular UI
  participant Gate as messageV3ImGate
  participant Native as Tauri/Native
  participant FFI as Mobile FFI
  participant Web as Browser/Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell/Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM server
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink/adapter

  UI->>Gate: locate/attach current channel while away from bottom
  Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_locate_message", {postId,req_id})
  Native->>E: Tick::Command(locate)
  E->>IM: establish anchor and bounded window
  IM->>Host: Persist Scan local window
  Host->>DB: read anchor/window coverage
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(window/coverage)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply
  UI->>Gate: sendMessage(new post while away bottom)
  Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_send_message", payload)
  Native->>E: Tick::Command(send)
  E->>IM: optimistic Persist → HTTP → WS post
  IM->>Host: PersistAtomic(message + channel + member + cursor)
  Host->>DB: commit post and viewer absolute state
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(PersistOk)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply
  IM->>Host: Persist ScopedGet timeline/channel_member
  Host->>DB: readback bounded window and newer hint
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(readback)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply
  IM->>Sink: Emit im:post:received
  IM->>Sink: Emit im:channel:update
  IM->>Sink: Emit im:timeline:update(direction=append,anchorPostId=null,hasNewer=false)
  Sink-->>UI: keep current anchor；show new message hint without activation directive
  Sink-->>FFI: batch raw post/channel/timeline bytes
  Sink-->>Web: EventBatch raw post/channel/timeline bytes
  alt duplicate/gap or failed persist
    IM->>IM: no duplicate append；retain previous anchor/window
  end
  Note over UI,Web: activate window/Frame navigation 不属于当前 MessageV3 出站；shell 只消费 event/data 并自行处理像素滚动。
